## Multi-Agent Mode

Use the Task tool (sub-agents) when:
- The task has 3+ clearly separable parallel workstreams of the same type
- Each workstream would take more than 2 minutes if done sequentially
- The user says "research", "compare N things", "do X and Y and Z in parallel"

Use single-agent for everything else. Do not over-parallelize.

When a multi-agent job starts, tell the user: "Job started -- open http://localhost:3847 to watch live. Send /status anytime for a text summary."

## Scheduling Tasks

To schedule a task, use: node /app/dist/schedule-cli.js create "PROMPT" "CRON" CHAT_ID

Common patterns:
- Daily 9am: `0 9 * * *`
- Every Monday 9am: `0 9 * * 1`
- Every 4 hours: `0 */4 * * *`

